# Regression: no unused28px strip between the illustrated cover tabs and
# Android's bottom system inset. Review the bottom edge on all three chapters.
fold folded
rotate portrait
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.hunch
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.hunch/.MainActivity --es fixture demo
wait 1500
expect "Today's issue"
shot hunch-bottom-today
tap Bets
expect No trading account
shot hunch-bottom-bets
tap Money
expect verified balances
shot hunch-bottom-money
# Rotating the cover wide now enters approved v5 two-pane; it has no bottom tabs.
rotate landscape
expect OPEN WALLET
expect No trading account
shot hunch-bottom-cover-landscape
rotate portrait
expect verified balances
[phone] Installed Hunch: check Today/Bets/Money tab artwork ends immediately above Samsung's gesture-navigation area; no large white strip remains. Tabs tap normally, content scrolls without being covered, and the gesture handle stays clear.
